sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User / Browser
  participant NextServer as Next.js App / Proxy (:3000)
  participant NestApi as NestJS API (:3001)
  participant PgDb as PostgreSQL (:5432)

  %% 1. LOGIN FLOW
  Note over User,PgDb: 1. Authentication & Session Establishment (Login)
  User->>NextServer: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
  NextServer->>NestApi: Forward POST /auth/login { email, password }
  NestApi->>PgDb: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = $1
  PgDb-->>NestApi: User record (bcrypt password_hash, role)
  NestApi->>NestApi: bcrypt.compare(password, password_hash)
  alt Invalid Credentials
    NestApi-->>NextServer: 401 Unauthorized { message: "Invalid credentials" }
    NextServer-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
  else Valid Credentials
    NestApi->>NestApi: Sign JWT (sub: id, email, role, exp: 8h)
    NestApi-->>NextServer: 200 OK { accessToken: "eyJ...", user: { id, email, role } }
    Note over NextServer: Store JWT in httpOnly Cookie (finpilot_token)
    NextServer-->>User: 200 OK + Set-Cookie: finpilot_token=eyJ...; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax
  end

  %% 2. PROTECTED REQUEST FLOW
  Note over User,PgDb: 2. Protected Request via Next.js Server-Side Proxy
  User->>NextServer: GET /api/customers/C0001/portfolio (Cookie: finpilot_token=eyJ...)
  Note over NextServer: Proxy extracts cookie and sets Bearer Authorization header
  NextServer->>NestApi: GET /customers/C0001/portfolio<br/>Authorization: Bearer eyJ...
  NestApi->>NestApi: JwtAuthGuard validates token signature & expiry
  alt Expired or Tampered Token
    NestApi-->>NextServer: 401 Unauthorized
    NextServer-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
    Note over User: TanStack Query catches 401 -> Sonner toast -> Redirect to /login
  else Token Valid & Authorized
    NestApi->>NestApi: RolesGuard checks user.role permissions
    NestApi->>PgDb: Query portfolio data & views
    PgDb-->>NestApi: Rows returned
    NestApi-->>NextServer: 200 OK { portfolioSummary, accounts, positions }
    NextServer-->>User: 200 OK JSON payload
  end

  %% 3. SWAGGER FLOW
  Note over User,PgDb: 3. Direct Swagger / API Access
  User->>NestApi: GET /customers/C0001/portfolio (No Token)
  NestApi-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
  User->>NestApi: Authorize with pasted token -> GET /customers/C0001/portfolio<br/>Authorization: Bearer eyJ...
  NestApi-->>User: 200 OK

  %% 4. LOGOUT FLOW
  Note over User,PgDb: 4. Session Termination (Logout)
  User->>NextServer: POST /logout
  Note over NextServer: Clear finpilot_token cookie (Max-Age=0)
  NextServer-->>User: 302 Redirect /login + Set-Cookie: finpilot_token=; Max-Age=0
